5,1,1,talk,Rin,,Let's make this fun! I want to know how much time we actually waste every morning and what happened with those sudden shuffles last year.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I am interested in the financial side. I will look into the floor billing basis and the facilities quote for power and network.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,We should be fair about the layout. I'll check the drawn plan against the staff survey and the badge records for arrival times.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shion,,Logic dictates we prioritize the actual environment. I'll examine the sound meter readings and the physio's note from the workstation check.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I want us to stay connected! I'll look into the two project strands from last spring and what the new joiners reported.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
